    "show_share": true,
    "description": "International Women's Day at AKU in Tanzania offered more than a celebration; it was a moment for reflection and inner strength. Under the theme \"For ALL Women and Girls: Rights, Equality, Empowerment,\" the campus became a canvas painted with moments of wellness, a sanctuary where students and faculty together with Jubilee Insurance and Aga Khan Education Services, gathered to nurture their minds and bodies.",
